B.aRl=new A.a4(B.aUk,["DASH tipi beslenme: tuzu azalt (g\xfcnde <5 g), sebze-meyve, baklagil ve s\xfct \xfcr\xfcnlerini art\u0131r.","Karbonhidrat\u0131 kesmek de\u011fil, \xf6\u011f\xfcnlere yaymak: her \xf6\u011f\xfcnde protein + lif, tam tah\u0131l, d\xfczenli \xf6\u011f\xfcn saati.","Karbonhidrat say\u0131m\u0131 ve ins\xfclin dozu uyumu birebir planlan\u0131r.","Nefes darl\u0131\u011f\u0131nda s\u0131k ve k\xfc\xe7\xfck \xf6\u011f\xfcnler; yeterli protein kas g\xfcc\xfcn\xfc korur; kilo kayb\u0131 istemsizse dikkat.","Fazla kilonun %10 azalmas\u0131 bile apne \u015fiddetini azaltabilir; ak\u015fam yeme\u011fi erken ve hafif.","\u0130la\xe7 a\xe7 karn\u0131na al\u0131n\u0131r; kahvalt\u0131yla aras\u0131 planlan\u0131r. \u0130yot ve selenyum dengesi.","Protein, potasyum, fosfor ve s\u0131v\u0131 miktar\u0131 tahlillere g\xf6re ki\u015fiye \xf6zel ayarlan\u0131r; y\xfcksek proteinli diyetler uygulanmaz.","Doymu\u015f ya\u011f\u0131 azalt, lif ve omega-3'\xfc art\u0131r; Akdeniz tipi beslenme.","%7\u201310 kilo kayb\u0131 karaci\u011fer ya\u011f\u0131n\u0131 belirgin azalt\u0131r; \u015fekerli i\xe7ecek ve fruktozu s\u0131n\u0131rla.","\u0130ns\xfclin direncine y\xf6nelik dengeli tabak, d\xfczenli hareket ve uyku.","Tetikleyici besinler ki\u015fiye g\xf6re belirlenir; gerekirse d\xfc\u015f\xfck FODMAP plan\u0131.","Protein \xf6nceli\u011fi, k\xfc\xe7\xfck porsiyon ve vitamin-mineral takibi."],t.w)
