B.aBw=s(["Gebelikte kilo verme hedefi konmaz. \xd6nerilen art\u0131\u015f gebelik \xf6ncesi BK\u0130'ye g\xf6re de\u011fi\u015fir (IOM 2009): normal kiloda 11,5\u201316 kg, fazla kiloda 7\u201311,5 kg, obezitede 5\u20139 kg.","Obezitesi olan gebelerde daha az kilo al\u0131m\u0131n\u0131n g\xfcvenli olabilece\u011fini g\xf6steren yeni \xe7al\u0131\u015fmalar var; bu karar mutlaka hekim ve diyetisyen kontrol\xfcnde verilir.","\xc7i\u011f et, \xe7i\u011f yumurta, past\xf6rize edilmemi\u015f s\xfct \xfcr\xfcnleri ve y\xfcksek c\u0131val\u0131 bal\u0131klardan (k\u0131l\u0131\xe7, k\xf6pek bal\u0131\u011f\u0131) ka\xe7\u0131n."],t.s)
B.biv=new A.mC("Kilo al\u0131m\u0131 hakk\u0131nda",B.aBw,B.aQ,null)
B.aAK=s(["Yaln\u0131zca anne s\xfct\xfcyle besleyen annenin enerji ihtiyac\u0131 g\xfcnde yakla\u015f\u0131k 500 kcal artar; s\u0131v\u0131 ihtiyac\u0131 da artar.","Kilo kayb\u0131 yava\u015f olmal\u0131 (ayda en fazla ~2 kg); \xe7ok d\xfc\u015f\xfck enerjili diyetler s\xfct miktar\u0131n\u0131 etkileyebilir.","Bal\u0131k (haftada 2 kez, d\xfc\u015f\xfck c\u0131val\u0131), yumurta, s\xfct \xfcr\xfcnleri ve baklagil \xf6nemli."],t.s)
B.biw=new A.mC("Emzirme d\xf6neminde",B.aAK,null,null)
B.aMJ=s(["Karbonhidrat\u0131 kesmek de\u011fil, \xf6\u011f\xfcnlere dengeli da\u011f\u0131tmak gerekir: her \xf6\u011f\xfcnde protein + lif.","Kan \u015fekeri \xf6l\xe7\xfcmlerini not al; plan\u0131n\u0131 bu \xf6l\xe7\xfcmlere g\xf6re birlikte d\xfczenleriz.","Do\u011fumdan sonra 4\u201312. haftada tekrar \u015feker testi \xf6nerilir."],t.s)
B.bix=new A.mC("Gebelik diyabeti",B.aMJ,B.cU,null)
B.axv=s(["Folik asit gebelikten en az 1 ay \xf6nce ba\u015flan\u0131r (hekiminle konu\u015f).","Sa\u011fl\u0131kl\u0131 kiloya yakla\u015fmak do\u011furganl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve gebelik sa\u011fl\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 destekler."],t.s)
